{"id":61456,"titulo":"Free! Iwatobi Swim Club","titulo_orig":"","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/owoZ7XlWMqnahtkIaQjWXPIHt3U.jpg","release_date":"2013-07-04","genres":["drama"],"rating":"8.2","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ghOUf1gzmBhbdKJrAjylLE983R9.jpg","overview":"Free! gira en torno a los miembros del equipo de natación de un chico de secundaria. Cuatro niños, Haruka, Makoto, Nagisa y Rin, participaron en un torneo de natación poco antes de graduarse de la escuela primaria y luego se separaron. Años más tarde, se reúnen cuando Rin desafía a Haruka a una carrera y gana. Nagisa decide que Haruka y Makoto vuelvan a nadar juntas y agrega un nuevo recluta llamado Rei para formar el Iwatobi High School Swimming Club.","trailer":"","slug":"free","servidores":[{"id":1,"url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-5q2t3fjfq31i.html","idioma":"JAPONÉS - SUBTÍTULOS LATINO","nombre":"Vimeos","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"embed-5q2t3fjfq31i.html","player_url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-5q2t3fjfq31i.html"},{"id":2,"url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-hobqs1csiy80.html","idioma":"JAPONÉS - SUBTÍTULOS LATINO","nombre":"Goodstream","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"embed-hobqs1csiy80.html","player_url":"https://goodstream.one/embed-hobqs1csiy80.html"},{"id":3,"url":"https://hlswish.com/e/bgzi300rm5v6","idioma":"JAPONÉS - SUBTÍTULOS LATINO","nombre":"Hlswish","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"bgzi300rm5v6","player_url":"https://hlswish.com/e/bgzi300rm5v6"},{"id":4,"url":"https://voe.sx/e/a8hjxeloab47","idioma":"JAPONÉS - SUBTÍTULOS LATINO","nombre":"Voe","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"a8hjxeloab47","player_url":"https://voe.sx/e/a8hjxeloab47"},{"id":5,"url":"https://filemoon.sx/e/n911gn5nokgn","idioma":"JAPONÉS - SUBTÍTULOS LATINO","nombre":"Filemoon","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"n911gn5nokgn","player_url":"https://filemoon.sx/e/n911gn5nokgn"},{"id":6,"url":"https://vimeos.net/embed-1uxaqqp2de3r.html","idioma":"JAPONÉS - SUBTÍTULOS LATINO","nombre":"Vimeos","calidad":"HD","embed_id":"embe